│  ├── Partitioned by business keys (date, region)           │
│  ├── Storage: S3 Standard                                  │
│  └── Purpose: Source of truth for analytics                │
│                          ↓ Aggregation                     │
│                                                             │
│  AGGREGATED ZONE (Consumption/Gold)                        │
│  ├── Pre-computed summaries, KPIs, materialized views      │
│  ├── Optimized for specific use cases (dashboards, ML)     │
