SPARK UI (Available for both Glue and EMR):
├── Jobs tab: Overall job progress
├── Stages tab: Individual stage details (shuffle, spill)
├── Storage tab: Cached RDDs/DataFrames
├── Executors tab: Memory/disk per executor
├── SQL tab: Query plans (logical + physical)
└── Access: Glue console → Job run → "Spark UI" tab

EXAM TRIGGER:
├── "Monitor Glue job memory usage" → CloudWatch metric: jvm.heap.used
├── "Detect idle EMR cluster" → IsIdle metric → auto-terminate
├── "Debug slow Spark stage" → Spark UI → Stages tab
├── "EMR needs more resources" → ContainerPending metric → scale up
└── "Track Glue job data volume" → bytesRead / recordsRead metrics

